          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What fabric options do you offer for baby clothing?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We offer organic cotton certified by GOTS for natural safety and sustainability (120-160 GSM), combed cotton for softness and reduced pilling (130-170 GSM), bamboo for natural antimicrobial properties (120-150 GSM), cotton blends for durability and easy care (140-180 GSM), and fleece for warmth and comfort (180-220 GSM). All fabrics are OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified for baby skin safety. Fabric selection depends on climate, season, intended use, and safety considerations, with extra attention to softness for baby comfort."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What baby clothing products can you manufacture?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We manufacture onesies and bodysuits in various sleeve lengths, rompers and jumpsuits for all-in-one convenience, sleepwear including pyjamas and sleep sacks, dresses and tops for girls, pants and shorts for boys, outerwear including jackets and snowsuits, and accessories including bibs, hats, and booties. We produce clothing for infants (0-12 months), toddlers (1-3 years), and children (4-12 years). Our facility handles both simple baby items and more complex constructions with safety considerations."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
