        </div>
        <div class="trust__item">
          <span class="trust__icon">?</span>
          <span>GOTS Organic</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust__item">
          <span class="trust__icon">?</span>
          <span>CPSIA Compliant</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust__item">
          <span class="trust__icon">?</span>
          <span>ISO 9001 Quality</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Introduction</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">Baby Clothing Manufacturer for Safe and Comfortable Children's Wear</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>As a specialized baby clothing manufacturer based in Bangladesh, SDF Clothing understands that infant and children's clothing requires exceptional safety, softness, and durability. The baby clothing market encompasses diverse needs from basic onesies for newborns to stylish clothing for growing children, requiring expertise in safe fabrics and secure construction. Our facility delivers on these requirements with minimum orders of 300 pieces, making professional baby clothing manufacturing accessible to emerging brands and established labels expanding their children's collections.</p>
        
        <p>Bangladesh has established itself as a competitive sourcing destination for baby and children's clothing, combining cost advantages with developing expertise in safe fabric garments. Our baby clothing production leverages Bangladesh's textile ecosystem, offering international brands access to skilled labor, established supply chains for organic cotton and baby-safe fabrics, and comprehensive manufacturing capabilities. The 300-piece minimum enables brands to test different baby clothing styles and fabric options without committing to large inventory positions, reducing risk while accessing factory-direct pricing.</p>
        
        <p>Our baby clothing manufacturing addresses the specific requirements of children's garments: certified safe fabrics that meet international safety standards, extra-soft materials for delicate baby skin, durable construction that withstands frequent washing, and secure construction with no loose components that could pose choking hazards. We work with organic cotton, bamboo, and certified safe materials to meet safety requirements while maintaining OEKO-TEX certification for chemical safety and CPSIA compliance for US markets.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Product Range</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">What We Manufacture</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>Our baby clothing production encompasses multiple product categories designed for different age groups from infants to children. Each category maintains our commitment to safe fabrics and secure construction while offering distinct comfort and style characteristics. We manufacture all categories from 300 pieces minimum, with the ability to mix categories within larger orders for comprehensive children's collections.</p>
        
        <p>Onesies and bodysuits represent our core infant category, including short-sleeve onesies for warm weather, long-sleeve bodysuits for cooler weather, and sleeveless bodysuits for summer. We produce envelope neck onesies for easy over-head dressing, snap-crotch bodysuits for convenient diaper changes, and kimono-style onesies with wrap closures for newborns. Onesies use soft fabrics like organic cotton or bamboo in weights ranging from 120-160 GSM. Construction emphasizes flat seams and secure snap closures. Onesies are essential infant wear and represent high-volume items in baby collections.</p>
        
        <p>Rompers and jumpsuits provide all-in-one convenience for babies and toddlers. We produce short rompers for warm weather, long-sleeve jumpsuits for cooler seasons, and overall-style rompers with adjustable straps. Styles include simple A-line rompers, more elaborate jumpsuits with decorative elements, and functional designs with pockets. Rompers use comfortable fabrics like cotton blends and soft jersey in weights ranging from 140-180 GSM. Construction emphasizes secure closures and comfortable fits that accommodate diapers. Rompers are popular for their convenience and cute styling in baby and toddler markets.</p>
        
        <p>Sleepwear for babies and toddlers includes pyjama sets, sleep sacks, and nightgowns. We produce two-piece pyjama sets with tops and bottoms, zippered sleep sacks for safe sleeping without loose blankets, and simple nightgowns for toddlers. Sleepwear uses breathable fabrics like cotton jersey or modal in weights ranging from 130-170 GSM. Construction emphasizes flame resistance compliance for certain markets and secure closures without loose components. Sleep sacks require specialized construction with appropriate neck and arm openings to prevent entrapment. Safe sleepwear is critical for infant and toddler markets.</p>
        
        <p>Dresses and tops for girls range from simple everyday dresses to more elaborate occasion wear. We produce casual dresses for everyday wear, party dresses with decorative elements, and simple tops and blouses. Styles include A-line dresses, empire waist designs, and smocked dresses for traditional appeal. These items use soft fabrics like cotton voile, modal, or jersey in weights ranging from 120-160 GSM. Construction emphasizes comfortable fits and secure embellishments without loose components. Girls' clothing requires attention to both style and practicality for active children.</p>
        
        <p>Pants and shorts for boys and girls include elastic-waist pants for easy dressing, shorts for warm weather, and more structured pants for older children. We produce pull-on pants with elastic waists for toddlers, jeans-style pants for older children, and various shorts styles. These items use comfortable fabrics like cotton twill, denim, or jersey in weights ranging from 140-200 GSM. Construction emphasizes durable seams and secure closures. Pants and shorts require careful attention to fit and durability for active children who spend significant time playing.</p>
        
        <p>Outerwear for children includes jackets, snowsuits, and vests for cold weather protection. We produce lightweight jackets for spring and fall, insulated snowsuits for winter, and fleece vests for layering. Outerwear uses appropriate fabrics including fleece, water-resistant materials, and insulation in weights ranging from 180-300 GSM depending on climate and intended use. Construction emphasizes secure closures, appropriate insulation, and safety considerations like reflective elements. Outerwear requires specialized construction for insulation and weather protection while maintaining safety standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-wrapper">
        <table class="comparison">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Age Group</th>
              <th>Fabric GSM</th>
              <th>Key Features</th>
              <th>Price Tier</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="comparison__row--highlight">
              <td>Onesies & Bodysuits</td>
              <td>Infant 0-12m</td>
