      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What is the minimum order quantity for baby clothing?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Our minimum order quantity for custom baby clothing is 300 pieces per style. This minimum allows you to access factory-direct pricing while testing market response with manageable inventory. The 300-piece minimum can be distributed across sizes within a single colorway. For baby sets counted as single styles, the minimum applies to the complete set. Lower quantities are available for sampling and prototype development at higher per-piece costs for brands requiring smaller initial runs.</p>
