        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What fabric options do you offer for baby clothing?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">We offer organic cotton certified by GOTS for natural safety and sustainability (120-160 GSM), combed cotton for softness and reduced pilling (130-170 GSM), bamboo for natural antimicrobial properties (120-150 GSM), cotton blends for durability and easy care (140-180 GSM), and fleece for warmth and comfort (180-220 GSM). All fabrics are OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified for baby skin safety. Fabric selection depends on climate, season, intended use, and safety considerations, with extra attention to softness for baby comfort.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
