          <p class="faq__answer">We manufacture onesies and bodysuits in various sleeve lengths, rompers and jumpsuits for all-in-one convenience, sleepwear including pyjamas and sleep sacks, dresses and tops for girls, pants and shorts for boys, outerwear including jackets and snowsuits, and accessories including bibs, hats, and booties. We produce clothing for infants (0-12 months), toddlers (1-3 years), and children (4-12 years). Our facility handles both simple baby items and more complex constructions with safety considerations.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Do you offer organic baby clothing manufacturing?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Yes. We offer GOTS-certified organic cotton baby clothing manufacturing from 300 pieces minimum. GOTS certification covers the entire supply chain from organic farming to final production, ensuring no synthetic pesticides, fertilizers, or harmful chemicals are used. Organic cotton costs approximately 15-20% more than conventional cotton but provides parents with assurance of chemical safety and environmental responsibility. We provide full GOTS certification documentation for marketing substantiation and retailer compliance requirements.</p>
